WHAT FILES THE TICKET NOW, AND WHAT EACH CLAIM RESTS ON

MEASURED against Atlassian, on 2026-08-29. `FileVerdict`, the `Executor` and
`snplow.atlassian.net` filed `ISP-276`. A second execution over the same
invocation reference answered `ISP-276` from `inspect` and created nothing. With
the claim removed from the ledger, `inspect` reached the search, asked
